---
import Dashboard from '../../../layouts/Dashboard.astro';
---

<Dashboard title="Billing & account" active="billing">
	<div class="alert alert-info mt-6">
		<span>Scaffold only. Billing is parked until the first key is issued.</span>
	</div>

	<div class="card mt-6 bg-base-100 shadow-sm">
		<div class="card-body">
			<h2 class="card-title">Plan</h2>
			<div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
				<span class="text-3xl font-semibold">Free</span>
				<span class="badge badge-ghost">catalog only</span>
			</div>
			<p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
				The catalog — exams, subjects, syllabi — never needs a key. Questions do.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="card mt-6 bg-base-100 shadow-sm">
		<div class="card-body">
			<h2 class="card-title">Invoices</h2>
			<div class="overflow-x-auto">
				<table class="table table-sm">
					<thead>
						<tr>
							<th>Date</th>
							<th>Reference</th>
							<th class="text-right">Amount</th>
							<th class="text-right">Status</th>
						</tr>
					</thead>
					<tbody>
						<tr class="text-base-content/50">
							<td colspan="4" class="py-6 text-center">No invoices yet.</td>
						</tr>
					</tbody>
				</table>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="card mt-6 bg-base-100 shadow-sm">
		<div class="card-body">
			<h2 class="card-title">Account</h2>
			<ul class="list-inside list-disc text-sm text-base-content/70">
				<li>Email and sign-in are not built; there is no account model yet.</li>
				<li>Billing ships with the dashboard, deliberately — not before.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>
</Dashboard>